body:
So the real problem here is that we _do_ report a warning (`console.warn`) but it is "too subtle". In VE this was a hard error: https://ng-run.com/edit/CGPY00WxXO8P9pelsgXH

I think that we should, as the very minimum, change the warning to error as currently it is very easy to miss those types of typos.

@Routhinator I'm going to re-open this issue so we can improve the error reporting here.
